{"id":"567189f4b7e57f6f","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs.md","title":"经典自指透明性与一致性不可兼得","display":"prop-truth-theory-trade-offs — 经典自指透明性与一致性不可兼得","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs","aliases":["91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs","91-prop-theory-trade-offs","91-prop-truth-theory-balances"],"display":"prop-truth-theory-trade-offs — 经典自指透明性与一致性不可兼得","depends_on":["[[91-lem-T-schema-limits]]","[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs</span><span>91-prop-theory-trade-offs</span><span>91-prop-truth-theory-balances</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-theory-trade-offs — 经典自指透明性与一致性不可兼得"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5f78118711a12b83\" href=\"?note=5f78118711a12b83\" title=\"91-lem-T-schema-limits\">91-lem-T-schema-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (含自身语言真理谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Classical}(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Classical}(\\mathcal S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 采用经典逻辑)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 能形成关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的说谎者)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FullTSch}_T(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\operatorname{FullTSch}_T(\\mathcal S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 对自身全部句子含 T-schema)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 句法一致)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}trade\\text{-}offs}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Classical}(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{FullTSch}_T(\\mathcal S)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}trade\\text{-}offs}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Classical}(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{FullTSch}_T(\\mathcal S)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是一个精确的不可兼得结论：说谎者\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 与其透明\n双条件合成，经典逻辑推出矛盾。相应方案必须限制实例语言、分层真理\n谓词、改变透明原则，或改变相关语义/推理规则。</p>\n<p>这并不推出“保守、强、经典、完整”四个未定义标签之间的一般布尔定律。\n例如标准 FS 保持经典外层逻辑，但没有不受限制的自指全 T-schema；\nKF 的经典外层公理化也与其强 Kleene 语义动机并存。具体保守性和强度\n仍需独立的证明论定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-lem-T-schema-limits","status":"resolved","id":"5f78118711a12b83","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-lem-T-schema-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Classical}(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FullTSch}_T(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}trade\\text{-}offs}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Classical}(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{FullTSch}_T(\\mathcal S)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\neg\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathcal S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1771,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["5f78118711a12b83","41fdad0bfaff0bf5"]}